{"type":"text","timestamp":"2026-10-22T09:48:07.756Z","data":{"text":"Task complete. Summary of what I did:\n\n**Implemented in `crates/features/show/src`:**\n- `model.rs`: added `path: PathBuf` to `Change` (from `Found.path`) and made `placeholder` reachable as `pub(crate) mod placeholder;`\n- `runs.rs`, `digest.rs`, `archived.rs`: reduced to `mod section;` + `pub(crate) use`; removed the old `LINES`/`VERIFICATION`/`VALIDATION`/`RECERTIFICATIONS`/`LAND` constants\n- New `runs/section.rs` (`task_lines(change, task)`), `digest/section.rs` (`lines(change)`), `archived/section.rs` (`verification`, `validation`, `recertifications`, `land`), all bodies exactly `vec![]`\n- `tasks.rs`: `runs::task_lines` now sits between `Verify:` and `Disclosures:`\n- `header.rs`: `archived::verification(change)` between `Next:` and `After landing:`\n- `text.rs`: `formatShowText` order — header, goal, contract, tasks, validation, planning, recertifications, events, land, digest\n\n**Verification:**\n- `cargo test -p osq-feature-show` — green, existing tests unedited\n- `OSQ_CHANGE=openspec/changes/274-rust-show sh scripts/verify-rust.sh` — format, workspace clippy `-D warnings`, and all tests pass\n- Manual `cargo mutants` on every changed file — no missed mutant (only unviable); `OSQ_DIFF` was unset so the script's own mutation step did not run\n\nResult written to `openspec/changes/274-rust-show/.run/results/2.md`."}}
